  "question": {
    "text": "Consider a parallelogram constructed on the vectors <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> and <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>.</mo></math> If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mover><mi>p</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mover><mi>q</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;the angle between <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> and <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;the length of the smallest diagonal of the parallelogram is <math><mi>k</mi></math>&nbsp;units, then the value of&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "109",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Diagonals of the parallelogram are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>4</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math><br /><math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>36</mn><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8901;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></msqrt></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>144</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>109</mn></msqrt></math><br /><math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>16</mn><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>40</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8901;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></msqrt></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>16</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>889</mn></msqrt></math><br />So, length of the smaller diagonal is <math><msqrt><mn>109</mn></msqrt></math>&nbsp;units"
